      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together ground beef, bread crumbs, cream of mushroom soup, eggs, Parmesan cheese, and onion soup mix. Shape beef mixture into 2-inch diameter balls; arrange on the prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
